l"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Nothing"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Cro is the self-proclaimed Goddess of Time, Chronos, who lives inside Rei's watch. Only he can see and talk to her, and he can't touch her either. Thus, Rei often thinks Cro to be a ghost appearing before him. Cro and Rei, her current owner, form a dynamic comedic duo, with Cro being the tsukkomi. One thing both of them can't understand is what exactly is the purpose of Cro's existence, and why she lives in Rei's watch."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"What about my appearance makes me resemble a ghost to you?\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29631"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは漫才コンビ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時計の神クロノス、を自称する懐中時計の精。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時計の所有者のみ姿を見ることと会話することができるが、触れることはできない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明確に時計を管理しよう、などという目的があるわけではなく、自分がなんのために存在しているのかもいまいち理解していない――本人もどうでもいいと思っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5965","sourceWorkId":"21224","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"時間の神・クロノスを自称する懐中時計の精。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時計の所有者のみ姿を見たり会話したりすることができるが、触れることはできない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現所有者である主人公とは、漫才コンビのような関係。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に目的もなく、自分が何のために存在しているのかイマイチ理解していない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その点に関しては、本人もどうでもいいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「どこをどう見たら、我輩が幽霊に見える？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30032"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30032","value":"テレビ鑑賞、モノレール"},{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30032","value":"主人公へのツッコミ"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30032","value":"人間と世界の観察"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"70 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5965","sourceWorkId":"21224","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"151 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5965","sourceWorkId":"21224","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"77 cm","val