lse,"text":"Likes: Stuffed toys, animals"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Latest electronics, people who break their promises"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rei's classmate who acts ostensibly like a normal girl. However, her friends often tell her that something's wrong in her head. Makoto is constantly hiding the fact that she's the daughter of a Yakuza family from her friends and classmates alike. Due to the influence from her family, she is very strong and short-tempered. Also loves cute things, and cannot restrain herself whenever she sees a plush toy anywhere."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Rei, what on earth are you doing, being this casual with a girl in the morning, hmmm?\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29632"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"要領が悪いところのある、目立った特徴がない可愛い少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、武闘派であるヤクザの組長を親に持つという秘密を抱えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体能力が意味不明なほど高く、戦闘力も高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ふぇぇ」 と一般人らしい演技をしているのを主人公がニヤニヤ見ていると、赤くなって「くっ、殺せ」 と思っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5960","sourceWorkId":"21224","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラスメイト。　要領が悪いところのある、パッと見 目立った特徴がない可愛い少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、武闘派であるヤクザの組長を親に持つという秘密を抱えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体能力が意味不明なほど高く、戦闘力も高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ふぇぇ」 と一般人らしく振舞っているのを主人公がニヤニヤ見ていると、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恥辱に顔を染め 内心で 「くっ、殺せ」 と思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「朝から女子を呼び捨てとは気やすいですねぇ♪」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30033"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30033","value":"ぬいぐるみ、動物全般"},{"label":"嫌い","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30033","value":"最新の電気機器、嘘や約束を守らないこと"},{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30033","value":"素手で鉄柱を折れる"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30033","value":"かわいいもの収集"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5960","sourceWorkI