ed-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"116262"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5963"],"vndbCharacterId":"c29635"},"originalCharacterName":"D・D","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"922"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"75"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"48"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Specialty: Making apple pie"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Japan's otakus"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Crowded trains, being quiet, the summer heat"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A British foreign exchange student who came to live with the Sawataris, and acts as their maid, referring to Rei as \"Master\" and Michiru as \"Mistress\". Born and raised in Britain, her grandfather was Japanese, effectively making her a quarter-Japanese herself, and through him, Dorothy got interested in Japan. In order to learn the language and culture of Japan, she constantly searched the Internet, but became especially interested in the otaku culture. Loves Japanese food above all else, since it doesn't fatten her up no matter how much she eats it. Frequently mixes English words into her speech."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"The food back home's such utter shite! Japanese and Chinese food's just marvelous!\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29635"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の？？。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれも育ちもイギリスだが、祖父が日本人のクォーター。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の家にホームステイしてきて、メイドとして振る舞う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言葉や文化の習熟に日本でネットをまわっているうちに、オタクに染まってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本食が大好きでどれだけ食べても太らないが、胸も大きくならないことに悩んでいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5963","sourceWorkId":"21224","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の？？。　主人公の家にホームステイしてきて、メイドとして振る舞う少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれも育ちもイギリスだが、祖父が日本人のクォーター。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言葉や文化を学ぶため、日本でネットを巡っていたらオタクに染まってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本食が大好きで、どれだけ食べても太らないが、胸も大きくならず悩んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「イギリスのご飯はほんとにマジーのです！　和食と中華はサイコーです！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30036"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30036","value":"日本のオタクコンテンツ"},{"label":"嫌い","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30036","value":"おとなしくすること、満員電車、夏の暑さ"},{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30036","value":"アップルパイ作り"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30036","value":"艦○れ"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"75 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5963","sourceWorkId":"21224","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"161 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5963","sourceWorkId":"21224","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5963","sourceWorkId":"21224","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5963","sourceWorkId":"21224","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a7525a8f3704b89c2d3009db3cb7f2a4850f5148b16815bdad6fd1f2fb227445.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f294f95cbcd81369eac5a3b3aa1fc8de588c4a62c1df21cf1e761566e901af93.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大久保藍子","creatorId":"vndb:s361","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s361","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s361","name":"大久保 藍子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:116262:30036:5075:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c29636","characterName":"鈴木 みう","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"30037","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"116262"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5964"],"vndbCharacterId":"c29636"},"originalCharacterName":"鈴木 みう","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1013"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"71"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Specialty: Housework in general"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Trying on clothes (especially fashionable ones)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Her father, the peaceful everyday"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Angry people, trouble, rain, barking dogs"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rei's kouhai, who grew up in a poor, motherless environment compared to the general population. She is a very timid girl with social anxiety, especially around other boys, but at the same time, she is very optimistic, never letting a small thing get her down. Stutters often when talking to people. Her first meeting with Rei was the beginning of everything."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Do you really need a reason to fall in love?\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29636"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一般人よりやや貧しい父子家庭で育った今どきの子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性に対して猛烈な人見知りをする照れ屋でありながら、同時に前向きさと勇敢な心も持ち合わせているチグハグ少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おどおどしているが、言いたいことを言い過ぎるプチ毒舌さもあり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女との話ですべてが始まる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5964","sourceWorkId":"21224","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の後輩。　一般人よりやや貧しい父子家庭で育った今どきの子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性に対して猛烈な人見知りをする照れ屋でありながら、同時に前向きで勇敢な心も持ち合わせているチグハグ少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"オドオドしているが、言いたいことを言い過ぎる プチ毒舌 さもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と彼女との出会いが、すべての始まりとなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「人を好きになるのに、理由って必要なんですか？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30037"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30037","value":"お父さん、平和な日常"},{"label":"嫌い","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30037","value":"怒ってる人、揉め事、雨、吠える犬"},{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30037","value":"家事全般"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30037","value":"試着（おしゃれは大好き）"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"71 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5964","sourceWorkId":"21224","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"152 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5964","sourceWorkId":"21224","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"79 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5964","sourceWorkId":"21224","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5964","sourceWorkId":"21224","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/206cc2a6f8f90a59dc75c1987de99918dbce6923391fecd3e09388cd95445c79.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/4415e37126a6941